    "text": "SERMO IN LAETANIA MAIORE DE AUGURIIS.\nSE APOSTOL PAULUS, EALRA \u00d0EODA LAREOW, MANODE \u00d0A Cristenan \u00fee he sylf \u00e6r to\n\u00de\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc so\u00f0lice gewin\u00f0 ongean \u00f0one gast, and se gast ongean \u00fe\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc.\n\u00deas \u00f0incg so\u00f0lice, \u00f0\u00e6t is se lichama and seo sawl winna\u00f0 him betweonan.\nAc seo sawl is \u00f0\u00e6s fl\u00e6sces hl\u00e6fdige, and hire gedafna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo simle gewylde \u00f0a wylne, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dewyrlice f\u00e6r\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00f0am huse \u00fe\u00e6r seo wyln bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re hl\u00e6fdian wissigend, and seo hl\u00e6fdige bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re\nSe apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif ge beo\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00f0one gast gel\u00e6dde, \u00f0onne ne synd ge na under \u00e6.\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 on o\u00f0re stowe, Nis nan \u00e6 rihtwisum menn gesett, ac unrihtwisum and na under\u00feeoddum,\nSe rihtwisa so\u00f0lice ne \u00feearf him ondr\u00e6dan \u00fea sti\u00f0an steora \u00fee Godes \u00e6 t\u00e6c\u00f0, gif he him sylfum styr\u00f0\nPaulus cw\u00e6\u00f0, swutele synd \u00fe\u00e6s fl\u00e6sces weorc, \u00fe\u00e6t is forligr and uncl\u00e6nnyss, estfulnyss o\u00f0\u00f0e galnyss,\nGehwa mot yfeles geswican and gebetan, ac gif he \u00f0urhwuna\u00f0 on yfelnysse and forsih\u00f0 his scyppendes\nEft cw\u00e6\u00f0 se apostol on o\u00f0rum pistole, Fratres, Nolite errare; Neque fornicarii, Neque idolis seruientes,\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea git eft for\u00f0 to \u00feam folce \u00f0us, \u00feis ge w\u00e6ron ac ge synd nu afeormode, ac ge synd\nDeofolgild bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man his drihten forl\u00e6te, and his Cristendom, and to deofollicum h\u00e6\u00f0enscype\nO\u00f0er deofolgild is derigendlic \u00fe\u00e6re sawle, \u00f0onne se man forsih\u00f0 his scyppendes beboda, and \u00fea\n\u00de\u00e6s gastes w\u00e6stmas synd \u00fea godan \u00f0eowas, \u00fe\u00e6t se man lufige \u00feone lifigendan God, and h\u00e6bbe \u00f0a\nNis nan \u00e6 wi\u00f0err\u00e6de \u00feus geworhtum mannum, ac \u00f0a \u00fee Cristes synd cwylmia\u00f0 heora fl\u00e6sc, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi\nAgustinus se snotera bisceop s\u00e6de eac on sumere bec, Mine gebro\u00f0ra \u00fea leofestan, gelome ic eow\nNu alyse ic me sylfne wi\u00f0 God, and mid lufe eow forbeode, \u00fe\u00e6t eower nan ne axie \u00feurh \u00e6nigne\nHleotan man mot mid geleafan swa \u00feeah on woruld\u00f0ingum butan wiccecr\u00e6fte, \u00fe\u00e6t him deme seota, gif\nEall swa gelice se \u00f0e gelyf\u00f0 wiglungum o\u00f0\u00f0e be fugelum o\u00f0\u00f0e be fnorum o\u00f0\u00f0e be horsum o\u00f0\u00f0e be\nNe sceal nan man cepan be dagum on hwilcum d\u00e6ge he fare, o\u00f0\u00f0e on hwylcum he gecyrre, for\u00f0an \u00fee\nAc se\u00f0e hwider faran wille, singe his paternoster, and credan, gif he cunne and clypige to his Dryhten,\nUs sceama\u00f0 to secgenne ealle \u00f0a sceandlican wiglunga, \u00fee ge dw\u00e6smenn drifa\u00f0 \u00f0urh deofles lare,\nAc wite ge to so\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t se sceocca eow l\u00e6r\u00f0 \u00feyllice scincr\u00e6ftas \u00fe\u00e6t he eowre sawla h\u00e6bbe \u00f0onne ge\nNu cwy\u00f0 sum wiglere \u00fe\u00e6t wiccan oft secga\u00f0 swa swa hit ag\u00e6\u00f0 mid so\u00f0um \u00f0incge.\nNu secge we to so\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t se ungesewenlica deofol \u00fee flyh\u00f0 geond \u00feas woruld, and fela \u00f0incg gesih\u00f0,\nFela s\u00e6don \u00fea drymen \u00feurh deofles cr\u00e6ft, Iamnes and mambres, swa swa Moyses awrat, and hi\nEall swa eac Symon se swicola dry, swa lange he wan wi\u00f0 Petre, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wear\u00f0 afylled, \u00f0a \u00fea he\nFela o\u00f0re forferdon \u00fee folgodon drycr\u00e6fte, swa swa we on bocum r\u00e6da\u00f0, ac heora racu is langsum.\nNe sceal se Cristena befrinan \u00fea fulan wiccan be his gesundfulnysse, \u00feeah\u00f0e heo secgan cunne sum\nSume men synd swa ablende, \u00fe\u00e6t hi bringa\u00f0 heora lac to eor\u00f0f\u00e6stum stane, and