 aweddan, and urnon to \u00f0\u00e6re s\u00e6 and sona adruncon.\nNe m\u00e6g se deofol mannum derian butan Godes \u00f0afunge, ne heora \u00f0incg amyrran, \u00feonne he ne moste\nGif us deofol drec\u00f0, o\u00fe\u00fee ure \u00feincg adyd, \u00fe\u00e6t getima\u00f0 \u00feonne swa for twam intingum; o\u00fe\u00fee God swa\nUs becym\u00f0 swa \u00feeah eall \u00fe\u00e6t to gode, gif we beo\u00f0 ge\u00f0yldige and \u00feancia\u00f0 urum Drihtne, and on \u00f0\u00e6re\nL\u00e6cedom is alyfed fram lichamena tyddernysse, and halige gebedu mid Godes bletsunge; and ealla\nSwa swa Paulus awrat, \u00feysum wordum cwe\u00f0ende, Ne mage ge samod drincan ures drihtnes calic and\nNu secga\u00f0 sume menn \u00fe\u00e6t him sceole gelimpan swa swa him gesceapan w\u00e6s and geset \u00e6t fruman,\nNu secge we to so\u00f0an gif hit swa beon sceall \u00fe\u00e6t hit is unnyt bebod \u00f0e God bebead \u00feurh Dauid,\nAnd eft se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0, swa man swy\u00f0or swinc\u00f0 for Gode, swa he selran mede h\u00e6f\u00f0.\nGif \u00e6lces mannes lif \u00e6fre sceola swa gan \u00fe\u00e6t he ne m\u00e6ge forbugan bysmorlice d\u00e6da, \u00feonne bi\u00f0\nEac \u00f0a arf\u00e6stan beo\u00f0 wolice gearwur\u00f0ode, gif \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0 beon m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t him swa gesceapen w\u00e6s; and on\nGod \u00e6lmihtig gesceop manega gesceafta, and heora nanum ne forgeaf agenne freodom o\u00fe\u00fee\n\u00deas twa gesceafta habba\u00f0 gesceadwisnysse, and \u00e6lc man h\u00e6f\u00f0 agenne freodom, \u00fe\u00e6t he wat hw\u00e6t he\nHe sealde swi\u00f0e f\u00e6ste gife and swy\u00fee f\u00e6ste \u00e6, mid \u00fe\u00e6re gife \u00e6lcum menn o\u00f0 his ende, earmum and\n\u00de\u00e6t is seo gifu \u00fe\u00e6t se man mot don \u00fe\u00e6t he wile, and \u00fe\u00e6t is seo \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t God forgylt \u00e6lcum menn be his\nGif hwa nu wundrige hwi god wolde forgifan \u00feam yfelum mannum agenne freodom, \u00feone he wat on\nSwa eac ne gedafnode \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Drihtne \u00fe\u00e6t on eallum his rice n\u00e6re \u00e6nig gesceaft \u00fee n\u00e6re on\nNu behofa\u00f0 ure freodom \u00e6fre Godes fultumes, for\u00fean \u00f0e we ne do\u00f0 nan god butan Godes fultume.\nSe us gewissige a on \u00f0ysre worulde, and to \u00feam ecan life gel\u00e6de \u00feurh hine sylfne, swa swa he \u00feam\nSy him wuldor and lof a to worulde;Amen.",
